		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Gadget</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention powered by Toolbelt scraps. Activate for 1 scrap; spend a 2nd scrap for the Toolbelt effect. Only Engineers gain the active benefit &mdash; an ally given this gadget gains only the Passive.</em></p><hr><p><em>Considered a mace.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action (1 scrap):</strong> Reach 1, Damage 1d6+STR Bludgeoning. If you target your turret, you undeploy it and regain its Toolbelt scrap.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 scraps):</strong> Target is Dazed, 3 turns, or the turret lasts +3 rounds.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Turrets can be Tiny.</p>",
